There, law 15. The Maggid Mishneh writes that Rambam rules like Rabbi Yehudah in the baraita there, 30a, regarding the permission to bring refuse into the public domain during the season when refuse is removed, but unlike him regarding liability for damages, where we rule that he is liable. The Halakhot likewise write so.<br>
Beit Yosef cites this at the end of siman 414.<br>
